  "notes": "2023 Zambia Education Curriculum Framework (3-6-4-2), phased in from 2025: primary Grades 1–6 from age six, secondary Ordinary level Forms 1–4 (School Certificate exam after Form 4) and Advanced level Forms 5–6. Learners who began under the old 7-2-3 structure (Grades 1–12) finish in it; the last old-system exams are due in 2028. Three years of early childhood education are left out."
